config AOC_USF_IIO
	tristate "AoC USF sensor framework to IIO bridge"
	depends on IIO
	depends on GOOGLE_AOC_USF
	select IIO_BUFFER
	select IIO_KFIFO_BUF
	help
	  Bridge the sensors hosted by the AoC USF (Unified Sensor Framework)
	  firmware on Google Tensor devices to Linux IIO.  The driver loads the
	  sensor registry itself, out of the firmware search path, then
	  enumerates the sensors over the com.google.usf AOCC channel and
	  exposes them as IIO devices (accelerometer, gyroscope, magnetometer,
	  light, proximity, pressure).

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called aoc-usf-iio.

	  If unsure, say N.
